      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7878/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the cake: Generously spray a fluted tube pan (such as Bundt) with cooking spray. Whisk flour, baking powder, and salt together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter in a large bowl with an electric mixer until creamy. Add sugar and beat until fluffy. Beat in egg and vanilla. Add flour mixture in two batches, alternating with milk, beating batter briefly after each addition.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2nRUOwlI-9HkS3n6kKv61YQiNA0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7878-blueberry-coffee-cake-DDMFS-step-07-2896-b4abea2acffc417c928080c184e7e150.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7878/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread 1/2 of the batter in the prepared pan. Sprinkle blueberries over top, then add remaining batter, one spoon at a time.",
